iti48:3.1 starts: He goes to hell,
iti48:3.2 starts: as does the one
iti48:3.3 starts: Both–low-acting people–
iti48:3.4 starts: after death, in the world beyond.
iti48:5.1 starts: Better to eat an iron ball
iti48:5.2 starts: –glowing, aflame–
iti48:5.3 starts: than that, unprincipled &
iti48:5.4 starts: you should eat the alms of the country.
iti50:3.1 starts: Greed, aversion, delusion destroy
