iti58:4.1 starts: While those who’ve abandoned craving,
iti58:4.2 starts: free from the craving for becoming & non-,
iti58:4.3 starts: reaching the ending of effluents,
iti58:4.4 starts: though in the world,
iti59:3.1 starts: Virtue, concentration, discernment:
iti59:3.2 starts: one in whom these are well-developed,
